      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you please explain why we would need to cherry-pick upstream patches into android-mainline? These should land via the normal upstream merge, no?",
      "revId": "0db4eef5ac03e3f0719bd3a42c75b44feb6b5e51",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
